[#4471](/kb/incidents/4471) said: known, one issue, one fix queued. Its reports say three
problems, with three different fixes. Each problem has its own ticket. Engineering closed #4471
on 5 October. That closed two of the three problems, not all of them.

<Callout kind="warn">
The one-day move is still open: no fix, no owner. Closing #4471 does not close it. New reports
where a date moves by one day go to its ticket, not to #4471.
</Callout>

## What #4471 holds

